  "title": "Hike on Stroomi rand",
  "date": "2026-09-05T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Hike on Stroomi rand\n\nToday, we went hiking along stroomi beach. As it is near to where I live, I can directly walk there. We started from the Zoo.\n\nSelfie\n\nThere are several surfers surfing on the sea.\n\nsurfing\n\nsurfing\n\nThe day is extra clear, like Windows XP bliss background.\n\ngroup photo\n\nThe end of this hiking trail, is another trail we used to take in Kopli. We went to the apple tree we used to pass by, however the apples are not sweet.",
